      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CURYO DANCER (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 1.75 lengths at The Gardens in a handy 22.98 beating Tommy Tsunami. Can continue on with her winning form. BOTH BOWERS ACE (5) was strongly fancied last time but finished second (30.10), beaten a nose. Expected to feature again. ZIPPING HOPKINS (8) wound up strongly to place two back then did the same last time, finishing on late when third (26.65) in a Mix 1/2/3 at Bulli. Solid record at the distance winning 16 races. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Will give a great sight again. ERUPT (6) is very honest and looms as a strong winning hope again.",
